10:T451,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/#organization","name":"M1sch1ef Managed","url":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/"},{"@type":"WebPage","url":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003","name":"The Hollow Hoard — Edition 3: The Counterfeit Crown","description":"A glittering auction offers Ren the career he wanted. Looking closer at its impossible crown could cost him everything.","inLanguage":"en","isAccessibleForFree":true,"publisher":{"@id":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/#organization"}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"M1sch1ef Comics","item":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/comics"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"The Hollow Hoard","item":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/comics/the-hollow-hoard"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"The Hollow Hoard — Edition 3: The Counterfeit Crown","item":"https://m1sch1efmanaged.com/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003"}]}]}1:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}],["$","$L11","the-hollow-hoard/issue-003",{"seriesSlug":"the-hollow-hoard","seriesTitle":"The Hollow Hoard","issue":{"slug":"issue-003","number":3,"title":"The Counterfeit Crown","nextTitle":"The Beast Beneath Bell Row","summary":"A glittering auction offers Ren the career he wanted. Looking closer at its impossible crown could cost him everything.","publishedAt":"2026-10-29T01:13:02.547Z","storyPages":12,"cover":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/00-cover.webp","pages":[{"number":0,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/00-cover.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"ba4967ec29408e4123be7a0081d9457d43a8cb0b888462ad0afb5b0209a1a36a","description":"The Counterfeit Crown, Edition 3 of The Hollow Hoard: cover.","dialogue":[]},{"number":1,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/01.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"818e153de917b2494d2de92aa999b467931c88e0e2efe464e3a5ee64c77ec41e","description":"An auction crown projects a royal figure. Ren joins the appraisers while Tamsin checks the loading route and Latch stays safe with Pella.","dialogue":["AUCTIONEER: The last king's memories. Preserved for a thousand years.","REN: A thousand years. Conveniently hard to verify.","TAMSIN: Inspection. Evidence. Out. In that order.","PELLA: They'll come back. Try not to eat my hinges."]},{"number":2,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/02.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"0ca339db9f9d448c4abb9ee9db2be3b8ecb46c0ac47c3335db97a90faf653ea2","description":"Ren receives a consignment manifest bearing the familiar buyer’s mark. He spots Dane above the hall and signals Tamsin near the exit.","dialogue":["CLERK: Initial the provenance. Keep your copy.","REN: Vey Collection.","REN: We have an audience.","TAMSIN: Then keep yours busy."]},{"number":3,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/03.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"01dfbd712e1decebb555753c7ba42f8614b7994af6c4c0cc1240a1ab54bc840b","description":"An auction agent offers Ren a permanent appraisal desk if he certifies the crown. Ren asks to inspect it first.","dialogue":["AGENT: Calder. We need a reliable signature.","AGENT: A salary. Proper tools. No quay fees.","AGENT: Confirm the age. Start tomorrow.","REN: Let me see what I'm signing."]},{"number":4,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/04.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"3a4663a459abe75466ad51b6d3a5b64656e481c8d18d7a9940f2145330f647ff","description":"Ren notices movement beneath the crown’s housing. Its supposedly ancient king repeats a gesture just made by the auctioneer.","dialogue":["REN: Something's moving.","REN: Do that again.","AUCTIONEER: Is this part of your valuation?","REN: It isn't remembering a king. It's reflecting you."]},{"number":5,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/05.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"237698603df93d0d898a23e11af86002ac3682ed3eb080e57288e06674c31bca","description":"Inside the crown, Ren finds a restrained living moth whose wings replay recent images. The agent presses him to accept the salary.","dialogue":["REN: There's an animal inside.","AGENT: A living optic. Historically accurate craftsmanship.","REN: You advertised memories. You knew people would hear something else.","AGENT: People are paying for a story, Calder."]},{"number":6,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/06.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"931605facffe67f3c6ed4553ab5499b7dfa2b795ca6648c749a12285a4666483","description":"Ren refuses to sign and demonstrates the false history to the bidders. A handler moves to restrain the moth more tightly.","dialogue":["REN: Then they deserve the true one.","REN: Ask it to show an event from before we entered.","BIDDER: Then what am I bidding on?","AGENT: End the inspection."]},{"number":7,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/07.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"311f25aa2d3dfae0d596e261a6b77fd298e61296fb3f6ad6d3c63960925d1ccf","description":"Tamsin brings a padded box. Ren disconnects the display’s power before releasing the catch and freeing the moth.","dialogue":["TAMSIN: Transport clearance.","REN: Pull the feed first.","SFX: CLICK","REN: Your choice. This way."]},{"number":8,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/08.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"53126914761115528090d402d7a305dc945b44c354fa0363bbc45ba04dd4e519","description":"Angry bidders confront the agent while Dane protects people in the crowd. Tamsin and Ren escape through the loading door.","dialogue":["BIDDER: You certified this.","DANE: Back. Give him room.","TAMSIN: Ren. Exit.","AGENT: That offer won't come again.","REN: I know."]},{"number":9,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/09.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"d1c01235f920955136a41ca12536b3ba979e20ce5cfb1ef3bb71eeaddbecee8c","description":"Outside, Ren loses his appraisal access but keeps the inspection manifest. The pair carry the rescued moth away.","dialogue":["TAMSIN: Any other jobs you want to decline today?","REN: They've decided for me.","DANE: Calder released the specimen. Tell Vey.","TAMSIN: You kept the records?","REN: The copy they gave me."]},{"number":10,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/10.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"4055994b7adeb3af6ccd29d0a33760da5930a673b646284c291ccd6943d33105","description":"At Pella’s kiln, Mirror Moth rests in a shaded nook. Its reflected workshop image fades as time passes.","dialogue":["PELLA: One more. Still no menagerie.","REN: It keeps what it just saw.","TAMSIN: Not ancient memories.","REN: Not even yesterday.","PELLA: Let it rest."]},{"number":11,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/11.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"27d6ed8d2563dda4d388ad9a0c8c74acb964181bd68201676741926429cddcd4","description":"Ren and Tamsin compare the manifest with Latch’s clamp. The recorded transfer happened before their brass-key recovery job was posted.","dialogue":["REN: Specimen nine. Coastal warden trial. Return pending.","TAMSIN: Their trial. Their chain.","REN: They left it there. Then hired us to fetch it.","TAMSIN: Vey's testing living things as parts."]},{"number":12,"src":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/images/12.webp","width":1024,"height":1536,"sha256":"bb046e47e73af9257133768ad514265221d5bc30a6220adb8e666c56dd8bd3c1","description":"The next transport names Bell Row and specimen 003. With sundown approaching, the pair head for the pump station.","dialogue":["REN: Another transfer. Today.","TAMSIN: Sundown. We can still make it.","AGENT: He wouldn't certify it.","VEY: Then remove his access.","CAPTION: NEXT: THE BEAST BENEATH BELL ROW."]}],"pdf":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-003/The-Hollow-Hoard-03.pdf","pdfSha256":"9faf1affaef0ced842d14820d1bee3d91805c0b1f21caabb920f59e7589234c3","pdfBytes":19827822},"nextIssue":{"title":"The Beast Beneath Bell Row","href":"/comics/the-hollow-hoard/issue-004"},"nextReleaseAt":null,"seasonEnd":false}]]
